/* SMACK! Windows resource script.
 *
 * Gives smack.exe its icon in Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab. The window
 * icon is set separately at runtime via SDL_SetWindowIcon (res/icon_rgba.h),
 * which is what covers Linux, where there is no resource section.
 *
 * smack.ico is generated from tools/appicon.png by tools/make-icon.ps1 and is
 * committed, so building needs no image tooling.
 *
 * Windows shows the icon with the numerically lowest resource ID, hence 1.
 */

1 ICON "smack.ico"
